    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑρκ-εῖος</span></b>  (freq. written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρκειος</span> in codd.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ch.</u>
			653
		</span></i>:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>in the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕρκος</span> or <i>front court,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς Ἑ.,</span> as the household god,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.335
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				487
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.Jun.
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				302d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				401a20
			</span></i> : abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρκεῖος, ὁ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				4.17.4
			</span></i> ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμὸς ἑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Pae.</u>
					6.114
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑρκεῖοι, οἱ,</span>
			= Lat. <i>Penates,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.67
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύλαι, θύρα ἑ.,</span> the gates, door
				<i>of the court,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				561
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				571
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				653
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς κίον᾽ ἑρκείου στέγης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					108
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ἑρκείῳ πυρᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					483
				</span></i>
			.</div>
